 `PUBLISHING.md`).
 
 ## [Unreleased]
+
+### Changed
+
+- **Same-position repeats.** When both sweeps report the same identified output
+  and microphone, Core EQ level-aligns and averages their shared clean bands and
+  saves that correction with the first sweep's provenance. Unknown, ambiguous,
+  unconfirmed or changed paths keep the first sweep as the correction. Target,
+  room and ceiling changes clear the repeat evidence before re-analysis.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- **Cancelled sweeps.** A stopped or superseded stimulus cannot start playback,
+  leak audio focus or release a newer playback's resources. Late analysis
+  callbacks are ignored before sweep analysis and before seat/check/refinement
+  fitting.
 
